The pepperoni is 4 slices, each about 5 cm across. Each slice weighs roughly 3 g, so about 12 g in total. The cheese and sauce are part of the slice and I list them separately.

I split the weight as follows: crust and base about 80 g, cheese about 25 g, and pepperoni about 10 g.

